  "body": [
    "Home",
    "Valtech and Salesforce; Navigating New Customer Behavior",
    "With customer behavior and expectations changing on a nearly constant level, companies wondering how best to navigate those changes are in need of a digital partner with a strong background working in the tech that's powering the future. Making use of our Salesforce Commerce Cloud solution is one way to ensure your brand will be able to weather the current changes as well as better anticipate and respond to changes in customer behavior still to come.",
    "Valtech is teaming up with Salesforce to help you lower the risk and expense involved with providing the digital experiences your consumers want faster and simpler than before. Those investments are helping us to work with businesses across multiple industries to get the best ROI from these investments and stand out to the competition.",
    "E-commerce sites are taking over physical stores, as consumers are increasingly taking their shopping online. When Bolon came to us, their vision was simple: to allow prospective customers to shop where, how, and when they want.",
    "Our solution: a responsive end-to-end e-commerce site focused on the customer experience.",
    "Read the case",
    "With multiple websites across countries, it was important to be tuned into the specific brand needs in each location, and Salesforce was the chosen solution. Instead of just a fully functional shopping cart, we developed a commerce platform with high performance capabilities on mobile, 24/7 support, and with Agile operations that will allow for swift upgrading and the rollout of new features in the future.",
    "Read the case",
    "If you're interested to see how Salesforce Commerce Cloud can help you meet the changes in customer behavior your company is facing, contact us today."
  ],
